 "steps": {
  "head": "Test steps, in order (M1)",
  "items": [
   [
    "1",
    "Photo both boards wired, before power."
   ],
   [
    "2",
    "Plug in the radio board only. Flash ot-rcp with the DIO18/DIO12 pins."
   ],
   [
    "3",
    "Plug in the host board. Load the host image (CCStudio scripting, no power cycle)."
   ],
   [
    "4",
    "On the host console: `rcp version` must answer with TI's OPENTHREAD/1.4 string."
   ],
   [
    "5",
    "`dataset init new`, `dataset commit active`, `ifconfig up`, `thread start`."
   ],
   [
    "6",
    "`state` reads leader in 16 s fresh, 37 to 39 s after a restart. Record PAN, channel, time."
   ],
   [
    "7",
    "Pull the yellow wire: `state` must stop answering. Replace it: it recovers."
   ],
   [
    "8",
    "Put each board back on what it ran before; the host README has the restore commands."
   ]
  ]
 },
